+The native AIS/Tagger/Torch batch also passed **15/15 in 5.5 minutes**. Adjacent `ui`, `windows`,
+`app`, `smoke`, `worldfile` checks passed **20/20 in 1.4 minutes**. This is not a claim that the
+entire 449-test browser suite or the unrelated PF1e failures below are green.
+
